orld-famous orchestra conductor discovers the brother he never knew he had — a school cafeteria worker who plays trombone in a local marching band. Detecting his brother's exceptional musical talent, he takes it upon himself to rectify the injustice of fate."},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Thibaut est un chef d’orchestre de renommée internationale qui parcourt le monde. Lorsqu’il apprend qu’il a été adopté, il découvre l’existence d’un frère, Jimmy, employé de cantine scolaire et qui joue du trombone dans une fanfare du nord de la France. En apparence tout les sépare, sauf l’amour de la musique. Détectant les capacités musicales exceptionnelles de son frère, Thibaut se donne pour mission de réparer l’injustice du destin. Jimmy se prend alors à rêver d’une autre vie…","tagline":"Certains liens ne peuvent se briser."}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iRf5AvURx2w0kbbRs29usFUzYuE.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iRf5AvURx2w0kbbRs29usFUzYuE.png","language":"it","width":738,"height":265},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aibHxS0eznxlsxkGBNbrL7XwYMb.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aibHxS0eznxlsxkGBNbrL7XwYMb.png","language":"en","width":1712,"height":327},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/muOFgLhgWquGiEJ8jwIwOwdZvy7.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/muOFgLhgWquGiEJ8jwIwOwdZvy7.png","language":"en","width":1712,"height":327},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/KIlkPZjj6pueApJ6tayTTiuOmJ.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/KIlkPZjj6pueApJ6tayTTiuOmJ.png","language":"en","width":1671,"height":162},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ewCm9B9rtoMAbC3zxJX8QdyrJLE.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ewCm9B9rtoMAbC3zxJX8QdyrJLE.png","language":"fr","width":2987,"height":1299}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/f